          "text": "$openspec-explore the implementation of the file-based prompts in the OMP (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/blob/main/packages/coding-agent/src/prompts/tools/)\n\nI want to transition our tool prompts to file-based templates, powered by our system-prompt template and offer the same customizability (we will need the same variables there, because tool prompts can be also modified in description based on the selected user/system settings.\n\nAnd additionally we will need some kind of `tools.<tool>` accessibility / enablement check, to be able to modify both system prompt and tool descriptions based on other tools available (e.g., hint using other tool for action when it is enabled, e.g., separate `grep` tool instead of the `bash(\"grep ...\")`\n\nExplore and run a short $grilling session before writing the proposal draft",
